; Example 5 variant: the transfer to the brokerage has no category line, so it is flagged.
option "title" "Uncategorized off-budget transfer"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-10-01 open Assets:Checking USD
  budget: "on"
2026-10-01 open Assets:Brokerage USD
  budget: "off"
2026-10-01 open Income:Salary USD
2026-10-01 open Expenses:Savings:Investing USD

2026-10-15 * "Paycheck"
  Income:Salary            -1000.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2026-11-02 * "Move to brokerage"
  Assets:Brokerage    500.00 USD
  Assets:Checking    -500.00 USD
